Package: @PKG_NAME@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: @SHLIBS_DEPENDS@, libc6-dev
Suggests: @PKG_NAME@-dbgsym, @LIBDBG_PKG@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gcc.gnu.org/
Description: GNU Compiler Collection @GCC_VERSION@ for @DIST_PRETTY@, installed in @PREFIX@
 GCC @GCC_VERSION@ (C, C++, Fortran, LTO) with its own GNU binutils
 @BINUTILS_VERSION@, built on @DIST_PRETTY@ and installed into the
 self-contained prefix @PREFIX@. It does not replace or touch the system
 compiler, libstdc++6 or libgcc, and coexists with other gcc-N-opt packages.
 .
 Nothing is installed outside @PREFIX@ except documentation and gdb
 auto-load scripts: call @PREFIX@/bin/gcc etc., or put @PREFIX@/bin on PATH.
 .
 Programs built with this compiler need the matching runtime libraries
 from @PREFIX@/lib64 at run time: link with -static-libstdc++ -static-libgcc,
 or add -Wl,-rpath,@PREFIX@/lib64.
